// UAC Bypass Using .NET Code Profiler on MMC | T1548.002 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/file/file_event/file_event_win_uac_bypass_dotnet_profiler.yml
from * metadata _id, _index, _version | where starts_with(file.path, "C:\\Users\\") and ends_with(file.path, "\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\pe386.dll")
